- New test file `src/game/mission/missionRegistry.test.ts` (12 tests): a mission contributes tick/tap/focus; exactly one mission active at a time; stable pass order; a mission with nothing to do contributes nothing.

Why:
FR13 requires that adding a third (park) and fourth (puppy) mission must not add a third copy of the tick/tap block in main.ts. The seam is deliberately bounded — a registry, not an FSM rewrite.

